        'The seeker asked in wonder, “Gurudev, is there really an account of all our deeds?” Guru Gorakhnath Ji said, “My child, before an order whose vastness the human mind cannot even imagine, how could the account of your deeds stay hidden?” A deed hidden from the world cannot hide from its consequences.',
        '<b>Awaken, seekers, awaken…</b> — Do not think no one is watching you. Even when you are alone, your deeds are with you. As you do, so shall be the result. But remember — the result does not always come in the form you imagined. Often it comes before you in some other form, beyond what you could think.',
